  "body": "We use this phrase for two out of four invocations of InitializeHostDefinedRealm(). Should we use it for all of them? It's not entirely clear what it means looking at the definition of InitializeHostDefinedRealm().\n\n(Aside: do you think it would be worthwhile to have an algorithm on the document-side that can be reused that invokes InitializeHostDefinedRealm() rather than invoking that three times?)\n",
